+- [x] Uses Airflow's `ds` parameter (scheduled execution date) instead of `datetime.now()`
+- [x] Both tasks use DELETE-before-INSERT pattern
+- [x] `catchup=True` is set (allows backfills)
+- [x] Table and column names unchanged (dashboard-safe)
