+#### Test 2: Idempotence (Re-run Safety)
+```bash
+# Run for 2026-03-02
+airflow dags backfill orders_daily_load --start-date 2026-03-02 --end-date 2026-03-02
+duckdb "SELECT COUNT(*), SUM(amount_usd) FROM warehouse/analytics.duckdb.orders WHERE order_date = '2026-03-02'"
+# Note: 5 rows, 1234.56 total
+
+# Re-run the exact same day
+airflow dags backfill orders_daily_load --start-date 2026-03-02 --end-date 2026-03-02
+duckdb "SELECT COUNT(*), SUM(amount_usd) FROM warehouse/analytics.duckdb.orders WHERE order_date = '2026-03-02'"
+# VERIFY: Still 5 rows, 1234.56 total (NO DUPLICATES) ✓
+```
+
